[/dim]prompts/202609/reachable_row_insert.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim] Parent: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/epic_panel_new_node_flicker.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-142.5[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-142/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]sase-142.5.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Decide rebuild scope per panel instead of per roster[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]panel-scoped-rebuild-gates[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]panel-scoped-rebuild-gates: make the three whole-roster predicates in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]_try_refresh_agents_display_incremental attribute a rebuild to the panel[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]keys they concern instead of rebuilding every panel, keeping the reason [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]observable per panel and covering it with a sibling-panel-change harness[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]scenario.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Admit the row shapes real arrivals actually have[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]reachable-insert-for-real-rows[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel-scoped-rebuild-gates[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reachable-insert-for-real-rows: decide on evidence whether a workflow [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]family that arrives whole can be inserted in place, implement that [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]answer under the existing insert-equals-rebuild contract, and either [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prove the shape reaches display_row_insert or name the topology [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]invariant that blocks it.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop applies that change no rendered row from repainting[/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]quiet-applies[dim] · [dim][/dim]after panel-scoped-rebuild-gates[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]quiet-applies: scope each panel's paint key to its own rows so a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fold-count change in one panel stops repainting the others, settle the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]agent-list column in-frame when a removal collapses a panel, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]re-measure the residual same-occupancy rebuilds by reason.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Re-soak with real arrivals, prove the insert, and close [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]sase-13i.4[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]reverify-arrivals-on-athena[dim] · [dim][/dim]after reachable-insert-for-real-rows, [/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#AF87FF][dim]quiet-applies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]reverify-arrivals-on-athena: re-run the landed-SHA athena soak with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]probes that can actually reach the insert, assert a nonzero [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]display_row_insert and the rest of the trace criteria, close sase-13i.4 [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with that evidence, and route the consolidated tui_perf.md update [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through the memory-write skill.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-142.5","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-142.5.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-15925967136c56f5659f7ef5fe9b1811","started_at":"2026-09-20T21:11:37.456529+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1789946325,"sha":"baf07cf13ceb9bada37390b98b61cab188f086f2","subject":"test(tui): pin the whole-family row-insert decline behind its banner invariant"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"32ba0c9219c